  "student_passage": "### 示例（已解，不计入五题）\n\nWhere will they meet?\n\nA. Inside the library.\n\nB. Outside the cafe.\n\nC. At the station.\n\n答案：B。A：图书馆提议被更改；B：明确改咖啡馆外；C：未提车站\n\n示例录音在材料1开头一遍，为本机示范编排；原示例精确播放次数未核，不把示例算第六道作答题。\n\n### 材料1\n\n[材料1（第1题；两遍；开头含已解示例）](../../../../build/english-benchmark-authority-20261017/original-audio/grade12-shortlisten-museum-deposit-extract1-v0.1.m4a)\n\n### 材料2\n\n[材料2（第2题；两遍）](../../../../build/english-benchmark-authority-20261017/original-audio/grade12-shortlisten-museum-deposit-extract2-v0.1.m4a)\n\n### 材料3\n\n[材料3（第3题；两遍）](../../../../build/english-benchmark-authority-20261017/original-audio/grade12-shortlisten-museum-deposit-extract3-v0.1.m4a)\n\n### 材料4\n\n[材料4（第4题；两遍）](../../../../build/english-benchmark-authority-20261017/original-audio/grade12-shortlisten-museum-deposit-extract4-v0.1.m4a)\n\n### 材料5\n\n[材料5（第5题；两遍）](../../../../build/english-benchmark-authority-20261017/original-audio/grade12-shortlisten-museum-deposit-extract5-v0.1.m4a)",
